{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24924","headline":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发 · 陈翥","name":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲江晴望好，近接梵王家。\n十亩开金地，千林发杏花。\n映云犹误雪，煦日欲成霞。\n紫陌传香远，红泉落影斜。\n园中春尚早，亭上路非赊。\n芳景堪游处，其如惜物华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈翥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}